      "id": "claim_5fc99be31a9f45e5a35e59ed914f56a8",
      "statement": "supabase/migrations files are treated as an append-only, additive history: schema evolution proceeds via new files adding columns/tables/functions rather than editing prior migrations, renames are rare and deliberate, and even documentation-only changes (e.g. new machine_type sentinel values) are added as their own migration rather than rewriting an existing constraint.",
